+| demo | 8 | 4 | 2 | 5 | no; illustration |
+| easy | 64 | 60 | 30 | 61 | **yes** |
+| medium | 128 | 60 | 30 | 125 | no; not needed |
+| hard | 256 | 60 | 30 | 253 | no; not needed |
