+  1: [v6,v0,v1,v7]
+  2: [v4,v1,v0,v7]
+  3: [v1,v5,v3,v0]
+  4: [v1,v2,v6,v7]
+
+Your answer is a GF(2) linear polynomial L on the public codes.
